# What a call and its reply cost (roadmap l4.md L4): 10,000 round trips
# between a program and a server of its making (tests/programs/ipc.asm with
# TEST_IPC_TIMING), as instructions on Bochs, which runs a fixed number a
# second. A regression check: no emulator gives an AT's clocks (l4.md E4).
program: ipc
emulators: bochs
define: TEST_CAPS
define: TEST_IPC_TIMING
define: TEST_END_TICKS=300
match: contains
timeout: 60
---
ipc: the server runs
ipc: a round trip within the budget
ipc: done
